  receives the RDKit descriptors, a graph network that starts from CheMeleon (a         model
  pretrained on about a million PubChem molecules), and a plain neural network on the Morgan
  fingerprints. All         are scored on the same 25 folds as every other model and compared with
  the same corrected tests.
